<main>
<section id="overview" class="panel active">
 <div class="section">
  <h2>项目包含</h2>
  <div class="include">
   <div class="incrow"><div class="incleft"><span class="icon">▣</span><span class="incname">酒店2晚</span></div><span class="incval">舒适型 · 8间</span></div>
   <div class="incrow"><div class="incleft"><span class="icon">▱</span><span class="incname">19座旅游中巴</span></div><span class="incval">3天 · 司机</span></div>
   <div class="incrow"><div class="incleft"><span class="icon">★</span><span class="incname">景点＋景交</span></div><span class="incval">岳麓书院等</span></div>
   <div class="incrow"><div class="incleft"><span class="icon">✓</span><span class="incname">保险＋服务</span></div><span class="incval">3天领队/导游</span></div>
   <div class="incrow"><div class="incleft"><span class="icon">餐</span><span class="incname">团队餐</span></div><span class="incval">5顿正餐＋早餐</span></div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="margin-top:25px">路线亮点</h2>
  <div class="badges"><span>五一广场</span><span>IFS</span><span>太平街</span><span>坡子街</span><span>湖南博物院</span><span>岳麓书院</span><span>岳麓山</span><span>爱晚亭</span><span>橘子洲</span><span>湘江夜景</span><span>天心阁</span></div>

  <h2 style="margin-top:25px">酒店安排</h2>
  <div class="hotel">
   <div class="hotelpic"><img loading="lazy" src="https://dimg04.c-ctrip.com/images/1mc2912000d1olyyj638F_W_1280_853_R5_Q70.jpg" alt="一束酒店（长沙五一广场IFS国金中心店）酒店实景"></div>
   <div class="hotelbody">
    <div class="hotelname">一束酒店（长沙五一广场IFS国金中心店）</div>
    <div class="stars">★★★★</div>
    <div class="hotelmeta">芙蓉中路定王大厦一带 · 便于连接五一广场、芙蓉广场及市区景点<br>建议房型：7间双床房＋1间大床房 · 共8间房 · 2晚</div>
    <div class="hotelprice"><b>预算≈¥8,000/团队</b><span>实际以确认时库存/报价为准</span></div>
   </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="margin-top:25px">团队执行标准</h2>
  <ul class="checklist">
   <li>15人统一安排19座旅游中巴，减少打车分散和集合等待</li>
   <li>每天预留休息窗口，不连续安排高强度步行</li>
   <li>湖南博物院安排在9月20日（周日），避免9月21日周一闭馆风险</li>
   <li>岳麓书院提前实名预约；入园需携带预约证件原件</li>
   <li>最终景点开放、预约、天气及车辆停车规则以出发前官方/供应商确认结果为准</li>
  </ul>
 </div>
</section>


