   <button class="route-tab active d1" data-day="1">Day 1 · 城市烟火</button>
   <button class="route-tab d2" data-day="2">Day 2 · 山水人文</button>
   <button class="route-tab d3" data-day="3">Day 3 · 老城慢游</button>
  </div>
  <div class="mapwrap real-map-wrap">
   <div id="real-map" class="real-map" aria-label="长沙真实地图"></div>
   <div class="map-badge">真实地图 · OpenStreetMap</div>
  </div>
  <div class="route-summary" id="route-summary"></div>
  <div class="route-legend"><span><i class="legend-dot ld1"></i>Day 1</span><span><i class="legend-dot ld2"></i>Day 2</span><span><i class="legend-dot ld3"></i>Day 3</span></div>
  <div class="route-info"><strong id="route-title">Day 1｜五一广场 → IFS国金中心 → 太平街 → 坡子街 → 杜甫江阁</strong><p id="route-desc">真实地图展示当天景点位置，并沿实际道路绘制行程路线；景区内部以步行为主。</p></div>
 </div>

 <div class="day">
  <div class="dayhead"><div><div class="daytag">DAY 1</div><div class="daytheme">城市烟火 · 老街 · 湘江夜景</div></div><div class="daydate">09/19 周六</div></div>
  <div class="timeline">
   <div class="item"><div class="time">09:00—10:00</div><div class="place">长沙集合</div><div class="desc">长沙南站/黄花机场/指定地点集合。19座中巴接站，统一装载行李。</div></div>
   <div class="item"><div class="time">10:00—11:00</div><div class="place">酒店寄存行李</div><div class="desc">团队签到、分房信息登记；若酒店允许提前入住则直接办理。</div></div>
   <div class="item has-spot"><div class="time">11:15—12:20</div><div class="spot-card"><img loading="lazy" src="https://dimg04.c-ctrip.com/images/1mh0e12000ayut0r6B5DF_W_640_10000.jpg?proc=autoorient" alt="长沙五一广场"><div><div class="place">五一广场</div><div class="desc">城市核心商圈地标，团队合影、城市漫步。全年开放，具体以当天情况为准。</div><div class="img-credit">图片参考：携程公开图片</div></div></div>
   <div class="spot-card"><img loading="lazy" src="https://n.sinaimg.cn/sinakd10111/221/w1079h1542/20210907/0c1b-b6279340d6a12c057b586c9bf1f1743d.png" alt="长沙IFS国金中心"><div><div class="place">IFS国金中心</div><div class="desc">打卡长沙城市潮流地标，可安排与KAWS雕塑合影。</div><div class="img-credit">图片参考：公开媒体图片</div></div></div></div>
   <div class="item"><div class="time">12:30—14:00</div><div class="place">长沙湘菜团队午餐 <span class="tag">含餐</span></div><div class="desc">建议3桌左右，菜品以剁椒鱼头、辣椒炒肉、小炒黄牛肉、时蔬为主。</div></div>
   <div class="item has-spot"><div class="time">14:10—16:00</div><div class="spot-card"><img loading="lazy" src="https://dimg04.c-ctrip.com/images/1mh0e12000ayut0r6B5DF_W_640_10000.jpg?proc=autoorient" alt="太平街"><div><div class="place">太平街</div><div class="desc">历史街区慢游，适合拍照、逛小店与体验长沙烟火气。</div></div></div>
